{
  "main": [
    {
      "id": "N01",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S01",
      "start": 0.49,
      "end": 6.602,
      "text": "早上七点半，桌上有三盒药，一张写了又划掉的单子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N02",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S02",
      "start": 7.99,
      "end": 12.878,
      "text": "哪盒饭前，哪盒饭后，昨天到底吃没吃——"
    },
    {
      "id": "N03",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S04",
      "start": 20.24,
      "end": 25.608,
      "text": "电话那头问一句『今天吃药了吗』，这头常常答不上来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S04",
      "start": 25.828,
      "end": 28.652,
      "text": "妈，今天药吃了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04-D02",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S04",
      "start": 28.872,
      "end": 30.904,
      "text": "……吃了吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N04",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S05",
      "start": 32.24,
      "end": 38.928,
      "text": "不是不上心。是字太小，规矩太多，一天要记好几回。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N05",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S06",
      "start": 40.24,
      "end": 45.392,
      "text": "在外的人，能做的也只剩再发一句『记得吃药』。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N06",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S07",
      "start": 49.24,
      "end": 53.408,
      "text": "可这件事，本来不该靠谁替她记着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N07",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S08",
      "start": 58.24,
      "end": 62.264,
      "text": "她没打开什么 App，只是说了一句话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S08",
      "start": 62.484,
      "end": 66.268,
      "text": "早饭后的那一次，帮我记上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S09",
      "start": 67.49,
      "end": 70.578,
      "text": "您听听对不对：早饭后那一次。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N08",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S10",
      "start": 74.49,
      "end": 78.298,
      "text": "药到。不用学，只要说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N09",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S11",
      "start": 82.49,
      "end": 87.474,
      "text": "这一段是设计示意，不是真机，也不是录屏。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N10",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S12",
      "start": 89.49,
      "end": 95.29,
      "text": "按设计，它一次只说一件事，说完等你，不打断。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N11",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S13",
      "start": 96.74,
      "end": 102.996,
      "text": "说定了，它把药名和时间复述一遍，问一句『您听听对不对』。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N12",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S15",
      "start": 110.74,
      "end": 115.868,
      "text": "建档，只要一句话；它会复述，不替您猜。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S15",
      "start": 116.088,
      "end": 119.872,
      "text": "早饭后的那一次，帮我记上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N13",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S16",
      "start": 121.24,
      "end": 125.312,
      "text": "问早上吃什么，它只念早饭那一段。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S16",
      "start": 125.532,
      "end": 127.996,
      "text": "早上该吃什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16-D02",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S16",
      "start": 128.216,
      "end": 130.824,
      "text": "早饭这一段，就这些。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N14",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S17",
      "start": 132.24,
      "end": 137.08,
      "text": "一句『我吃过了』，就算记上；漏了也不责怪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S17",
      "start": 137.3,
      "end": 139.332,
      "text": "我吃过了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N15",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S18",
      "start": 140.74,
      "end": 147.212,
      "text": "问一句今天吃得怎么样，它算出还差几次，说得清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S18",
      "start": 147.432,
      "end": 150.448,
      "text": "我今天吃药情况怎样？"
    },
    {
      "id": "N16",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S19",
      "start": 151.74,
      "end": 156.82,
      "text": "正忙着？说一声『等会儿』，它就晚一点再来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S19",
      "start": 157.04,
      "end": 159.528,
      "text": "等会儿再提醒我。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N17",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S20",
      "start": 160.99,
      "end": 166.694,
      "text": "下次唤醒它，到点还没打卡的那一次，它会先提一句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N18",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S21",
      "start": 168.99,
      "end": 173.158,
      "text": "记不清名字，就把药盒举起来给它看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S21",
      "start": 173.378,
      "end": 175.938,
      "text": "帮我拍个照记上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N19",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S22",
      "start": 177.24,
      "end": 182.368,
      "text": "它念出认到的内容，认不清的，一次只问一件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S22",
      "start": 182.588,
      "end": 185.436,
      "text": "是饭前吃还是饭后吃呀？"
    },
    {
      "id": "N20",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S24",
      "start": 189.74,
      "end": 194.556,
      "text": "一天还是那些事：早饭、午饭、晚饭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N21",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S25",
      "start": 197.74,
      "end": 202.58,
      "text": "只是现在，她自己问得清，也自己答得上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S25",
      "start": 202.8,
      "end": 206.056,
      "text": "早上那盒，我吃过了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N22",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S26",
      "start": 207.49,
      "end": 212.186,
      "text": "电话再响的时候，那句『吃了』，终于不用猜。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S26",
      "start": 212.406,
      "end": 215.83,
      "text": "吃了，早上那盒也吃了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N23",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S28",
      "start": 223.24,
      "end": 228.056,
      "text": "牵挂没变少，只是有了一个能被听见的地方。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N24",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S29",
      "start": 229.49,
      "end": 232.29,
      "text": "有些问题，它不接。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S29",
      "start": 232.51,
      "end": 234.782,
      "text": "这药能停了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29-D02",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S29",
      "start": 235.002,
      "end": 238.498,
      "text": "这事得问您大夫，我不敢替您拿主意。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N25",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S30",
      "start": 239.74,
      "end": 248.876,
      "text": "不推荐药，不改剂量；不舒服就让您找家人、找大夫；紧急情况，先拨 120。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N26",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S31",
      "start": 250.24,
      "end": 254.624,
      "text": "它管的不是病，是那句总被忘掉的『记得』。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N27",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S32",
      "start": 259.24,
      "end": 263.48,
      "text": "老人不会用智能手机，但一定会说话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N28",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S33",
      "start": 267.24,
      "end": 272.632,
      "text": "今天，给爸妈打个电话，问一句：今天吃药了吗。"
    }
  ],
